# Byte-exact repository: disable ALL line-ending conversion.
#
# Rationale (Phase 3B): tests pin sha256 hashes over byte-sensitive fixtures
# (tests/fixtures/vwap/*.csv). Any CRLF<->LF normalization would change those
# bytes on checkout and break the fresh-clone invariant on other platforms.
# The repository stores exactly the bytes in the working tree; editors keep
# whatever line endings each file already uses.
* -text
